# 第三方模拟器内核与测试 ROM 由开发期下载，不进仓库：
#   Peanut-GB      https://github.com/deltabeard/Peanut-GB   (MIT)
#   binjgb         https://github.com/binji/binjgb           (MIT)
#   gb-test-roms   https://github.com/retrio/gb-test-roms
#   libretro-fceumm (NES 后端，下一阶段)
third_party/*
# 例外一：Peanut-GB 的单头文件实现必须入库，保证全新克隆就能构建
!third_party/Peanut-GB
third_party/Peanut-GB/*
!third_party/Peanut-GB/peanut_gb.h
# 例外二：binjgb（GB+GBC 内核）只保留裁掉的 8 个源文件，同样必须入库；
# 搬运动作和改动清单见 third_party/binjgb/PORTING.md
!third_party/binjgb
third_party/binjgb/*
!third_party/binjgb/emulator.c
!third_party/binjgb/emulator.h
!third_party/binjgb/common.c
!third_party/binjgb/common.h
!third_party/binjgb/memory.c
!third_party/binjgb/memory.h
!third_party/binjgb/builtin-palettes.def
!third_party/binjgb/LICENSE
!third_party/binjgb/PORTING.md
